  "recommendation": "Promote the narrow SYN2 C generated-module-set and DYN2 A/B/dev-only typed route as current design/tooling contracts. Promote GenerationReference only as bounded read-only identity plus resolve/migration receipt; it carries no authority and does not convert to PersistentRef<P> or ServiceRef. Reject C2, D, live-state migration, eval/exec, frame mutation, ambient lookup, native sandbox, live dlclose callback, and production arbitrary hot reload. Do not claim implementation.",
  "stopCondition": "Stop on identity, authority, caller-echo, manifest, source-map, ABI, package, quota, cancellation, cleanup, OOM, fault, stale-generation, live-state, provider-ready, digest-chain, or reducer-divergence mutation. Reopen only with a bounded case, exact source and reused-study digests, independent evidence, and reviewed decision."
